{'symbol': 'AVY', 'date': '2022-05-17 09:00:00', 'title': 'AVERY DENNISON AND WILIOT ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO BUILD AND SCALE THE FUTURE OF THE INTERNET OF THINGS', 'text': "MENTOR, OHIO & SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVERY DENNISON CORPORATION (NYSE:AVY), THE WORLD'S LARGEST PROVIDER OF RFID AND DIGITAL ID SOLUTIONS, AND WILIOT, THE INTERNET OF THINGS PIONEER, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP DEDICATED TO SCALING THE IOT TO THE NEXT LEVEL, CREATING A NEW ERA OF IOT THAT BENEFITS PEOPLE AND THE PLANET. AVERY DENNISON WILL LEVERAGE ITS R&D CAPABILITIES AND SCALE TO DESIGN AND MANUFACTURE SECOND-GENERATION WILIOT TAGS, WHICH ARE STAMP-SIZED COMPUTERS POWERE"}